# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Alif – environment configuration
# Copy to .env.local for local development. Set the same variables in your
# hosting provider for production. All values are read on the SERVER only and
# are never sent to the browser (no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix on purpose).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Azure Speech (REQUIRED) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used for pronunciation assessment (/api/pronunciation, language ar-EG) and
# text-to-speech (/api/tts, voice ar-SA-ZariyahNeural).
# Without these, both endpoints answer 503 and the UI shows
# "Aussprache-Bewertung ist gerade nicht verfügbar".
AZURE_SPEECH_KEY=""
AZURE_SPEECH_REGION=""            # e.g. "germanywestcentral" or "westeurope"

# ── MASAAR pronunciation service (recommended) ──────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the self-hosted MASAAR letter-classification model, WITHOUT the
# /predict suffix, e.g. https://models.example.com/masaar
# Optional: if unset or unreachable, assessments continue without MASAAR data.
MASAAR_URL=""

# ── IQRA phoneme service (recommended) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the self-hosted IQRA phoneme model, WITHOUT the /predict suffix.
# Most letter rules need IQRA phonemes: without IQRA those attempts are
# reported as "not evaluable" instead of passing.
IQRA_URL=""

# ── Internal API key for MASAAR / IQRA ──────────────────────────────────────
# Sent as the X-Internal-Api-Key header to MASAAR and IQRA. Must equal the
# INTERNAL_API_KEY configured on the model server. Leave empty only if the
# model server runs without a key (local development).
INTERNAL_API_KEY=""
